e {\n        position: absolute;\n        top: -16px;\n        left: -16px;\n        width: 34px;\n        height: 34px;\n        background-color: #5ec0a5;\n        color: #fff;\n        border-radius: 50%;\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        justify-content: center;\n        font-weight: bold;\n        font-size: 16px;\n        z-index: 2;\n    }\n    .box-content {\n        background-color: #eeeeee;\n        color: #000;\n        padding: 20px 20px 20px 25px;\n        font-size: 13px;\n        line-height: 1.5;\n        height: 100%;\n        box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n\n    /* Footer Row */\n    .footer-row {\n        display: flex;\n        gap: 50px;\n    }\n    .col-refs {\n        flex: 1.5;\n    }\n    .col-concs {\n        flex: 1;\n    }\n    .ref-line {\n        border: 0;\n        height: 1px;\n        background-color: #444;\n        margin: 0 0 15px 0;\n        width: 100%;\n    }\n    .refs-title {\n        font-size: 12px;\n        font-weight: bold;\n        margin: 0 0 10px 0;\n    }\n    .refs-list {\n        margin: 0;\n        padding-left: 15px;\n        font-size: 10px;\n        color: #aaa;\n        line-height: 1.4;\n    }\n    .refs-list li {\n        margin-bottom: 8px;\n    }\n\n    /* Bottom Band */\n    .bottom-band {\n        height: 15px;\n        background-color: #5ec0a5;\n        width: 100%;\n        position: absolute;\n        bottom: 0;\n        left: 0;\n    }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"poster\">\n    <div class=\"header\">\n        <div class=\"logo-container\">\n            <div class=\"logo-main\">XAVIER'S<br>SCHOOL</div>\n            <div class=\"logo-sub\">OF GIFTED YOUNGSTERS</div>\n        </div>\n        <h1 class=\"header-title\">The Importance of Ocean Conservation:</h1>\n        <h2 class=\"header-subtitle\">Understanding<br>the Threats and Solutions</h2>\n        <p class=\"header-intro\">The ocean is a vital resource that supports life on Earth, yet it faces a growing number of threats from human activities. This poster provides an overview of the importance of ocean conservation and highlights the key threats facing the world's oceans.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"content\">\n        <div class=\"top-row\">\n            <div class=\"col-left\">\n                <h3 class=\"section-heading\">Background</h3>\n                <p>The world's oceans cover more than 70% of the Earth's surface and support a diverse range of ecosystems, including coral reefs, kelp forests, and open ocean habitats. However, the ocean is facing a growing number of threats, including climate change, overfishing, and plastic pollution. These threats can have far-reaching impacts on both marine and human life.</p>\n                \n                <h4 class=\"chart-title\">Global Ocean Heat</h4>\n                <div class=\"placeholder chart\">\n                    [Chart: Global Ocean Heat - Line graph showing an upward trend from 1960 to 2020. X-axis: decades from 1960 to 2020. Y-axis: -20 to 30. Area below the trendline is shaded blue.]\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"col-right\">\n                <h3 class=\"section-heading\">Methodology</h3>\n                <p>This poster presents a review of the latest research on the threats facing the world's oceans and the solutions being proposed to address them. The research draws on a range of academic sources, including peer-reviewed journal articles and reports from international organizations.</p>\n                \n                <div class=\"author-block\">\n                    <div class=\"placeholder photo\">[Photo:<br>Louie<br>Gardner]</div>\n                    <div class=\"author-text\">\n                        <span class=\"author-name\">Louie Gardner</span>\n                        <span>Affiliation: University of ABC</span>\n                        <span>E: name@universityname.edu</span>\n                        <span>P: 413-748-3004</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                \n                <hr class=\"divider\">\n                \n                <h3 class=\"section-heading\">Results</h3>\n                <p>The research shows that the threats facing the world's oceans are complex and interrelated, requiring a range of solutions to address them. Key findings include:</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"boxes-row\">\n            <div class=\"box-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"box-circle\">1</div>\n                <div class=\"box-content\">\n                    Climate change is causing ocean temperatures to rise, leading to coral bleaching and other impacts on marine life.\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"box-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"box-circle\">2</div>\n                <div class=\"box-content\">\n                    Overfishing is depleting fish populations, leading to ecological imbalances and economic losses for coastal communities.\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"box-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"box-circle\">3</div>\n                <div class=\"box-content\">\n                    Plastic pollution is a growing threat to marine life, with millions of tons of plastic waste entering the ocean each year.\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"footer-row\">\n            <div class=\"col-refs\">\n                <hr class=\"ref-line\">\n                <h4 class=\"refs-title\">References:</h4>\n                <ul class=\"refs-list\">\n                    <li>Intergovernmental Panel on Climate Change (IPCC). (2019). Special Report on the Ocean and Cryosphere in a Changing Climate.</li>\n                    <li>United Nations Environment Programme (UNEP). (2016). Marine Litter and Microplastics: Global Lessons and Research to Inspire Action & Guide Policy Change.</li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-concs\">\n                <h3 class=\"section-heading\">Conclusions</h3>\n                <p>This poster demonstrates the urgent need to address threats to the world's oceans. Among the potential solutions are greenhouse gas reductions, sustainable fishing practices, and better waste management and recycling. Protecting our oceans will ensure that life on Earth continues for generations to come.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"bottom-band\"></div>\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
